\newlabel{fig:sowing}{{1}{3}{\textbf {Flight sowing layout, porous foam water content, and 3D CFD airflow microclimate of the LEAF GBC1 growth chamber.} \textbf {a}, CAD schematic of the GBC1 body showing the three compartments separated by solid baffles at $Z = \pm 8.5\ \mathrm {mm}$ and the nominal 164-seed sowing layout ($8 \times 4$ \textit {B. rapa} in Chamber 1, $10 \times 10$ \textit {A. thaliana} in Chamber 2, $8 \times 4$ \textit {B. rapa} in Chamber 3) on the 35~$\mu $m Nytex screen ($Y = 14.77\ \mathrm {mm}$). \textbf {b}, Van Genuchten volumetric water content $\theta _w(x,z)$ across the phenolic foam substrate under lunar gravity ($g = 0.166g$). \textbf {c}, 3D CFD air velocity magnitude field $u(x,y,z)$ in Push airflow mode ($Q = 25\ \mathrm {mL\,min^{-1}}$), showing accelerated jet convergence into Chamber 2. \textbf {d}, Spatial distribution of boundary-layer conductance $g_{\mathrm {bl}}$ across all 164 seed locations}{figure.1}{}}
